  "issue_title": "result_compression does not work",
  "issue_body": "# Checklist\r\n- [x] I have verified that the issue exists against the `main` branch of Celery.\r\n- [ ] This has already been asked to the [discussions forum](https://github.com/celery/celery/discussions) first.\r\n- [x] I have read the relevant section in the\r\n  [contribution guide](https://docs.celeryq.dev/en/main/contributing.html#other-bugs)\r\n  on reporting bugs.\r\n- [x] I have checked the [issues list](https://github.com/celery/celery/issues?q=is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Issue+Type%3A+Bug+Report%22+-label%3A%22Category%3A+Documentation%22)\r\n  for similar or identical bug reports.\r\n- [x] I have checked the [pull requests list](https://github.com/celery/celery/pulls?q=is%3Apr+label%3A%22PR+Type%3A+Bugfix%22+-label%3A%22Category%3A+Documentation%22)\r\n  for existing proposed fixes.\r\n- [x] I have checked the [commit log](https://github.com/celery/celery/commits/main)\r\n  to find out if the bug was already fixed in the main branch.\r\n- [x] I have included all related issues and possible duplicate issues\r\n  in this issue (If there are none, check this box anyway).\r\n- [x] I have tried to reproduce the issue with [pytest-celery](https://docs.celeryq.dev/projects/pytest-celery/en/latest/userguide/celery-bug-report.html) and added the reproduction script below.\r\n\r\n## Mandatory Debugging Information\r\n\r\n- [x] I have included the output of ``celery -A proj report`` in the issue.\r\n    (if you are not able to do this, then at least specify the Celery\r\n     version affected).\r\n- [x] I have verified that the issue exists against the `main` branch of Celery.\r\n- [x] I have included the contents of ``pip freeze`` in the issue.\r\n- [x] I have included all the versions of all the external dependencies required\r\n  to reproduce this bug.\r\n\r\n## Related Issues and Possible Duplicates\r\n\r\n#### Related Issues\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/4838\r\n\r\n## Minimally Reproducible Test Case\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n<details>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Setup the Python environment\r\nconda create -n \"celery-compression\" python=3.11.9 ipython\r\nconda activate celery-compression\r\npython -m pip install --upgrade pip\r\npython -m pip install 'celery[zstd,redis]' 'fastapi[standard]'\r\n\r\n# Setup the project\r\nmkdir celery_compression && cd celery_compression\r\ntouch celery_app.py\r\ntouch api_app.py\r\n```\r\n\r\n**celery_app.py**\r\n```python\r\nimport time\r\n\r\nimport kombu\r\nfrom celery import Celery\r\n\r\napp = Celery(\"celery-compression\")\r\napp.conf.broker_url = \"redis://localhost:6379/0\"\r\napp.conf.result_backend = \"redis://localhost:6379/0\"\r\napp.conf.task_queues = [kombu.Queue(name=\"dummy\"), kombu.Queue(name=\"celery\")]\r\napp.conf.worker_concurrency = 1\r\napp.conf.worker_prefetch_multiplier = 1\r\napp.conf.task_compression = \"zstd\"\r\napp.conf.result_compression = \"zstd\"\r\n\r\n\r\n@app.task()\r\ndef dummy():\r\n    time.sleep(10)\r\n    return {\"Hello\": \"World!\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**api_app.py**\r\n```python\r\nfrom celery_app import dummy\r\n\r\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\r\n\r\napp = FastAPI(openapi_url=None, redoc_url=None)\r\n\r\n\r\n@app.get(\"/task\")\r\ndef task():\r\n    dummy.apply_async(queue=\"dummy\")\r\n    return {\"message\": \"task submitted\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Run Redis as backend & broker\r\ndocker run --rm --name some-redis -p 6379:6379 redis:latest\r\n\r\n# Start the API\r\nfastapi dev api_app.py --port 1545\r\n\r\n# Start the worker\r\npython -m celery --app='celery_app' worker --concurrency=1 --loglevel=DEBUG\r\n\r\n# Send the task to the worker\r\ncurl localhost:1545/task\r\n\r\n# Check the result\r\nredis-cli                         \r\n127.0.0.1:6379> KEYS *\r\n1) \"_kombu.binding.celery.pidbox\"\r\n2) \"_kombu.binding.celeryev\"\r\n3) \"_kombu.binding.celery\"\r\n4) \"celery-task-meta-4d0dfabb-6df4-4686-8c75-b46956ebf20c\"\r\n127.0.0.1:6379> GET \"celery-task-meta-4d0dfabb-6df4-4686-8c75-b46956ebf20c\"\r\n\"{\\\"status\\\": \\\"SUCCESS\\\", \\\"result\\\": {\\\"Hello\\\": \\\"World!\\\"}, \\\"traceback\\\": null, \\\"children\\\": [], \\\"date_done\\\": \\\"2024-10-21T19:47:02.877401+00:00\\\", \\\"task_id\\\": \\\"4d0dfabb-6df4-4686-8c75-b46956ebf20c\\\"}\"\r\n```\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n### Dependencies\r\n<details>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nconda list\r\n# packages in environment at /opt/homebrew/Caskroom/miniconda/base/envs/celery-compression:\r\n#\r\n# Name                    Version                   Build  Channel\r\namqp                      5.2.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nannotated-types           0.7.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nanyio                     4.6.2.post1              pypi_0    pypi\r\nasttokens                 2.0.5              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\nbilliard                  4.2.1                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nbzip2                     1.0.8                h80987f9_6  \r\nca-certificates           2024.9.24            hca03da5_0  \r\ncelery                    5.4.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\ncertifi                   2024.8.30                pypi_0    pypi\r\nclick                     8.1.7                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nclick-didyoumean          0.3.1                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nclick-plugins             1.1.1                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nclick-repl                0.3.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\ndecorator                 5.1.1              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\ndnspython                 2.7.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nemail-validator           2.2.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nexecuting                 0.8.3              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\nfastapi                   0.115.2                  pypi_0    pypi\r\nfastapi-cli               0.0.5                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nh11                       0.14.0                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nhttpcore                  1.0.6                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nhttptools                 0.6.4                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nhttpx                     0.27.2                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nidna                      3.10                     pypi_0    pypi\r\nipython                   8.27.0          py311hca03da5_0  \r\njedi                      0.19.1          py311hca03da5_0  \r\njinja2                    3.1.4                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nkombu                     5.4.2                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nlibffi                    3.4.4                hca03da5_1  \r\nmarkdown-it-py            3.0.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nmarkupsafe                3.0.2                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nmatplotlib-inline         0.1.6           py311hca03da5_0  \r\nmdurl                     0.1.2                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nncurses                   6.4                  h313beb8_0  \r\nopenssl                   3.0.15               h80987f9_0  \r\nparso                     0.8.3              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\npexpect                   4.8.0              pyhd3eb1b0_3  \r\npip                       24.2            py311hca03da5_0  \r\nprompt-toolkit            3.0.43          py311hca03da5_0  \r\nprompt_toolkit            3.0.43               hd3eb1b0_0  \r\nptyprocess                0.7.0              pyhd3eb1b0_2  \r\npure_eval                 0.2.2              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\npydantic                  2.9.2                    pypi_0    pypi\r\npydantic-core             2.23.4                   pypi_0    pypi\r\npygments                  2.15.1          py311hca03da5_1  \r\npython                    3.11.9               hb885b13_0  \r\npython-dateutil           2.9.0.post0              pypi_0    pypi\r\npython-dotenv             1.0.1                    pypi_0    pypi\r\npython-multipart          0.0.12                   pypi_0    pypi\r\npyyaml                    6.0.2                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nreadline                  8.2                  h1a28f6b_0  \r\nredis                     5.1.1                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nrich                      13.9.2                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nsetuptools                75.1.0          py311hca03da5_0  \r\nshellingham               1.5.4                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nsix                       1.16.0             pyhd3eb1b0_1  \r\nsniffio                   1.3.1                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nsqlite                    3.45.3               h80987f9_0  \r\nstack_data                0.2.0              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\nstarlette                 0.40.0                   pypi_0    pypi\r\ntk                        8.6.14               h6ba3021_0  \r\ntraitlets                 5.14.3          py311hca03da5_0  \r\ntyper                     0.12.5                   pypi_0    pypi\r\ntyping_extensions         4.11.0          py311hca03da5_0  \r\ntzdata                    2024.2                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nuvicorn                   0.32.0                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nuvloop                    0.21.0                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nvine                      5.1.0                    pypi_0    pypi\r\nwatchfiles                0.24.0                   pypi_0    pypi\r\nwcwidth                   0.2.5              pyhd3eb1b0_0  \r\nwebsockets                13.1                     pypi_0    pypi\r\nwheel                     0.44.0          py311hca03da5_0  \r\nxz                        5.4.6                h80987f9_1  \r\nzlib                      1.2.13               h18a0788_1  \r\nzstandard                 0.22.0                   pypi_0    pypi\r\n```\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n# Expected Behavior\r\nThe `result` field should be compressed\r\n\r\n# Actual Behavior\r\nThe result is stored as-is without getting compressed.\r\nI couldn't find a single place in the source code of Celery where `result_compression` config was referred.\r\n",
